  "description": "dream girl immediately drew me in with its mix of fashion, storytelling, travel, and a mission centered around helping girls chase their dreams. having spent a year abroad in italy and always wanting to see more of the world, i love how travel and different cultures are woven into the brand. i reached out directly to jo and kenz because i wanted to learn more about the brand and be part of what they were building. working closely with them has given me a behind-the-scenes look at what it takes to grow a brand, while getting to hear from the dream girls they support has shown me just how many amazing women are out there and the dreams they are helping make possible.",
